# Text is stored with LF and checked out with LF everywhere (code and docs are LF), except the two files kept CRLF by
# convention (CLAUDE.md, docs/research_protocol.md). Shell scripts must be LF for bash on the cloud VMs.
* text=auto eol=lf
CLAUDE.md text eol=crlf
docs/research_protocol.md text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.npz binary
*.npy binary
*.png binary
*.pt binary
